Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:33:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Chatter chat platform v0.1 (auth, friends, groups,
 TCP/WebSocket, attachments)

- Session auth with throttling; policies for conversations, friendships, messages, attachments
- Friend requests, 1:1 and group chats with owner/admin/member roles
- Real-time gateway (php artisan chat:serve): raw TCP + WebSocket on one port
- Private file attachments with sanitised serving, strict CSP, named rate limiters
- SpamDetector contract + messages.spam_* columns as hook for the AI module
- PHPUnit tests, Playwright e2e, docs (PROGRESS, ROADMAP, PROTOCOL) and CLAUDE.md

